## Flow: _example_

```
user ──submits form──▶ POST /api/${API_VERSION}/users
                         │
                         ▼
                      validate (zod)
                         │
                         ▼
                      check uniqueness
                         │
                  ┌──────┴──────┐
                  │             │
                exists       new
                  │             │
                  ▼             ▼
              409 reply      create record
                                │
                                ▼
                            201 reply + welcome job queued
```

